
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>A Little Birthday Surprise 🎀</title>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>A Little Birthday Surprise</h1>
        <p>Made with love, just for you ♡</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="welcome">
            <p class="small-text">A SPECIAL DAY FOR</p>

            <h2>Someone Wonderful</h2>

            <p>
                Today is all about you,
                your happiness, and all the beautiful
                moments waiting ahead.
            </p>

            <button id="surpriseButton">
                Open Your Surprise 🎁
            </button>
        </section>

        <section id="surprise" hidden>
            <h2>Happy Birthday! 🎂</h2>
<button id="surpriseButton" class="button">Open your surprise 💌</button>
<p id="surpriseMessage" class="hidden"></p>
            <p>
                May your day be filled with
                laughter, love, and magical memories.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>Created with love by Aurelle Studio</p>
    </footer>
<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
